# Denali Unified Semantic Token Schema

**Status:** Proposed (Phase U — token unification)  
**Authority:** Resolves drift documented in `docs/archive/root-forensics/TOKEN_DRIFT_ANALYSIS.md`  
**Prerequisite:** [dtcg-pipeline-spec.mdoc](../../dev/dtcg-pipeline-spec.mdoc) Phase F slice model

---

## Problem

Denali Admin and Portal each had hand-maintained DTCG slices with **divergent primary values** (`#0f766e` admin bridge vs `#059669` guest MASTER). **Wave 3 (D1 · 2026-07-12):** `palette.json` `forest-600` → `#059669`; shared semantics + token bridge + admin/portal/marketing CSS regenerate to one primary. Guest manifest themes (`workspace-guest-manifest-themes.generated.ts` in portal/marketing) must stay aligned with `buildDenaliTokenBridgeContexts().admin.cssVariables` — enforced by `denali-token-bridge.spec.ts` + `MKT-GX-03`.

## Goal

One **workspace-owned shared core** under `packages/workspaces/denali/theme/shared/` that composes into per-surface DTCG slices. Changing `color.primary` once propagates to Admin, Portal, and Marketing CSS on the next `design-tokens` build.

---

## Directory layout

```text
packages/workspaces/denali/theme/shared/
├── compose.manifest.json          # Compose config — surfaces, blocks, layer merge order
├── palette.json                   # Brand primitives (denali.forest-*, mist-*, alpine-*, bark-*)
├── semantics.light.json           # Shared color.* + flat.* (light) — THE cross-surface contract
├── semantics.dark.json            # Shared color.* (dark) — consumed by admin dark block only
├── contexts/
│   ├── admin.light-flat.json      # shadcn flat aliases, sidebar-*, shell-sidebar-width, shadows
│   ├── admin.dark-flat.json       # Dark flat + sidebar re-bind
│   ├── portal.flat.json           # Portal-only flat overrides (minimal — no sidebar)
│   └── marketing.overlay.json     # mkt.* marketing-only tokens
└── generated/                     # @generated — do not edit (gitignored or committed with --check)
    └── (optional snapshot for diff review)

packages/design-tokens/dtcg/workspaces/   # @generated from shared — input to CSS pipeline
├── denali.admin.tokens.json
├── denali.portal.tokens.json
└── denali.marketing.tokens.json

packages/workspaces/denali/theme/         # @generated CSS (existing pipeline)
├── admin-semantic-tokens.css
├── portal-semantic-tokens.css
└── marketing/semantic-tokens.css
```

### Layer responsibilities

| File | Editable? | Contains |
| ---- | --------- | -------- |
| `palette.json` | **Yes** | Raw brand palette — `denali.forest-600`, `denali.mist-50`, shadows |
| `semantics.light.json` | **Yes** | `color.primary` → `{denali.forest-600}`, bg/text/border, status colors, `flat.radius`, `flat.destructive` |
| `semantics.dark.json` | **Yes** | Admin dark `color.*` (portal does not consume today) |
| `contexts/admin.*.json` | **Yes** | Operator chrome: `--sidebar-*`, `--shell-sidebar-width`, flat→shadcn bridge |
| `contexts/portal.flat.json` | **Yes** | Portal scope-only extras (empty or radius confirm) — **no sidebar** |
| `contexts/marketing.overlay.json` | **Yes** | `mkt.*` hero/overlay tokens — marketing surface only |
| `denali.*.tokens.json` | **No** | Composed DTCG slices — `generate:denali-semantic-slices` |
| `*-semantic-tokens.css` | **No** | `generate-workspace-dtcg-css.mjs` (existing) |

---

## Compose pipeline

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  subgraph shared["theme/shared/ (human edit)"]
    P[palette.json]
    SL[semantics.light.json]
    SD[semantics.dark.json]
    CA[contexts/admin.*]
    CP[contexts/portal.flat]
    CM[contexts/marketing.overlay]
    M[compose.manifest.json]
  end
  subgraph compose["generate:denali-semantic-slices"]
    S[denali-semantic-slices.mjs]
  end
  subgraph dtcg["design-tokens/dtcg/workspaces"]
    A[denali.admin.tokens.json]
    PO[denali.portal.tokens.json]
    MK[denali.marketing.tokens.json]
  end
  subgraph css["design-tokens build"]
    G[generate-workspace-dtcg-css.mjs]
    ACSS[admin-semantic-tokens.css]
    PCSS[portal-semantic-tokens.css]
  end
  M --> S
  P --> S
  SL --> S
  SD --> S
  CA --> S
  CP --> S
  CM --> S
  S --> A
  S --> PO
  S --> MK
  A --> G
  PO --> G
  MK --> G
  G --> ACSS
  G --> PCSS
```

### Merge rules

1. **Deep merge** token groups left-to-right per `compose.manifest.json` `merge` array.
2. Later layers override earlier keys only at the **leaf** (`$value`) level.
3. DTCG references (`{denali.forest-600}`) are preserved as strings — resolution happens at CSS generation (existing `resolveDtcgReferenceValue`).
4. **Blocks format** (admin): each block gets its own merged object + `scopeSelector`.
5. **Single format** (portal, marketing): top-level `scopeSelector` + merged groups.

---

## Context model — what differs per surface

| Concern | Admin | Portal | Marketing |
| ------- | ----- | ------ | --------- |
| `scopeSelector` | `body[data-workspace-plugin="denali"]` | `body[data-app-surface="portal"][…]` | `body[data-app-surface="marketing"][…]` |
| Light `color.*` | From `semantics.light.json` | **Same merge** | **Same merge** |
| Dark mode block | `semantics.dark.json` + `admin.dark-flat.json` | **None** | **None** |
| `flat.sidebar-*` | `admin.light-flat.json` | **Excluded** | **Excluded** |
| `shell-sidebar-width` | Admin only | **Excluded** | **Excluded** |
| `mkt.*` overlay | **Excluded** | **Excluded** | `marketing.overlay.json` |
| `denali.shadow-card` | `palette.json` | Optional inherit | Optional inherit |

Portal and Marketing **inherit the same primary** because they include `palette.json` + `semantics.light.json` in their merge list. They do not include admin context files.

---

## Primary color — single edit, dual (triple) inheritance

### Edit surface (one place)

Developers change primary in **either**:

```json
// palette.json
"forest-600": { "$type": "color", "$value": "#059669" }
```

or (preferred — indirect):

```json
// semantics.light.json
"primary": { "$type": "color", "$value": "{denali.forest-600}" }
```

### Propagation chain

```text
1. Edit palette.json or semantics.light.json
2. pnpm run generate:denali-semantic-slices
   → rewrites denali.admin.tokens.json, denali.portal.tokens.json, denali.marketing.tokens.json
3. pnpm --filter @app-tour/design-tokens run build
   → generate-workspace-dtcg-css.mjs writes *-semantic-tokens.css
4. Apps load skin CSS on next deploy / dev HMR
```

### CI enforcement (no drift)

| Guard | When | What |
| ----- | ---- | ---- |
| `generate:denali-semantic-slices --check` | pre-commit / `guard-dtcg-css-sync` | Shared sources ↔ DTCG slices in sync |
| `generate-workspace-dtcg-css --check` | design-tokens build | DTCG slices ↔ committed CSS |
| `guard-denali-cross-surface-primary` (new) | phase-2 guard | Resolved `color.primary` identical in admin/portal/marketing slices |
| `guard-denali-manifest-theme-parity` (new) | phase-0 manifest guard | `workspace.manifest.json` `theme` `--ws-color-primary` matches `{denali.forest-600}` |

### Optional: manifest codegen

Extend compose to emit `workspace.manifest.json` `theme` block and `denali.plugin.ts` `cssVariables` from `semantics.light.json` + mapping table — eliminates fourth authority identified in TOKEN_DRIFT_ANALYSIS.

---

## compose.manifest.json schema

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "workspaceId": "denali",
  "sharedDir": ".",
  "outputs": [
    {
      "sliceFile": "denali.admin.tokens.json",
      "format": "blocks",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "scopeSelector": "body[data-workspace-plugin=\"denali\"]",
          "merge": [
            "palette.json",
            "semantics.light.json",
            "contexts/admin.light-flat.json"
          ]
        },
        {
          "scopeSelector": "html.dark:has(body[data-workspace-plugin=\"denali\"]), .dark body[data-workspace-plugin=\"denali\"], body[data-workspace-plugin=\"denali\"] .theme-dark",
          "merge": ["semantics.dark.json", "contexts/admin.dark-flat.json"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sliceFile": "denali.portal.tokens.json",
      "format": "scoped",
      "scopeSelector": "body[data-app-surface=\"portal\"][data-workspace-plugin=\"denali\"]",
      "merge": ["palette.json", "semantics.light.json", "contexts/portal.flat.json"]
    },
    {
      "sliceFile": "denali.marketing.tokens.json",
      "format": "scoped",
      "scopeSelector": "body[data-app-surface=\"marketing\"][data-workspace-plugin=\"denali\"]",
      "merge": [
        "palette.json",
        "semantics.light.json",
        "contexts/portal.flat.json",
        "contexts/marketing.overlay.json"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

---

## Commands

```bash
# Compose DTCG slices from shared (repo root)
pnpm run generate:denali-semantic-slices

# Drift check (CI)
pnpm run generate:denali-semantic-slices -- --check

# Full CSS regeneration (includes compose when wired)
pnpm --filter @app-tour/design-tokens run build
```

---

## Migration phases

| Phase | Work | Risk |
| ----- | ---- | ---- |
| **U0** | Add `theme/shared/` + compose script + docs (this spec) | None — slices unchanged until first compose run |
| **U1** | Run compose; portal/marketing primary aligns to forest-600 | Visual change on portal — intentional |
| **U2** | Wire compose into `generate-tokens.mjs` before `generateWorkspaceDtcgCss` | CI fails if shared edited without regen |
| **U3** | Add `guard-denali-cross-surface-primary` | Prevents future fork |
| **U4** | Codegen manifest `theme` + plugin `cssVariables` from shared | Removes manifest authority drift |
| **U5** | Replicate pattern for `urban`, `guest-club` | Workspace template in `workspace:create` |

---

## Extension to other workspaces

`scripts/codegen/workspace-semantic-slices.mjs` generalizes compose:

```text
packages/workspaces/<id>/theme/shared/compose.manifest.json
  → packages/design-tokens/dtcg/workspaces/<id>.{admin,portal,marketing}.tokens.json
```

Denali is the reference implementation; stub workspaces adopt the same `shared/` + `contexts/` split.

---

## Token Bridge (implemented)

Runtime and CSS bridge from `theme/shared/` into operator and guest surfaces.

| Layer | Module / file | Role |
| ----- | ------------- | ---- |
| **Shared resolver** | `packages/workspaces/denali/src/theme/denali-token-bridge.ts` | Reads `palette.json` + `semantics.light.json`; builds `--ws-*` maps |
| **Admin ingress** | `denali.plugin.ts` → `theme.cssVariables` | Admin context + sidebar tokens via `buildDenaliTokenBridgeContexts().admin` |
| **Guest ingress** | `DENALI_GUEST_SURFACE_CSS_VARIABLES` | Portal/marketing manifest `theme` contract (shared brand only) |
| **Portal CSS bridge** | `theme/denali-portal.css` | `--color-*: var(--ws-color-*, var(--color-*))` on `body` |
| **CI parity** | `pnpm run guard:token-parity` | Fails when `denali.admin.tokens.json` and `denali.portal.tokens.json` diverge on shared semantics |

```bash
pnpm run guard:token-parity
pnpm run generate:denali-semantic-slices   # sync DTCG slices from shared
```

